WEBVTT

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.960
Katsura-san, I love you.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.810
What's wrong?

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:27.610
Nah, it's nothing.

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:38.840
Haramihama. Haramihama.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:48.210
Sorry...

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.110
I wasn't able to go yesterday.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:53.050
Makoto-kun?

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.030
You waited for me in front of the Break Room, didn't you?

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:58.810
How do you know?

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:02.550
O-Oto- I heard from Katou...

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:04.050
Katou-san?

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:06.300
I can't say this very well, but...

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.430
No, it's okay!

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:09.380
But...

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:10.600
It's okay.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:14.040
Now that you've told me that...

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:26.570
Tear down work for the school fair

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.950
You're sure cheery this morning.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.760
Does it look that way?

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:31.840
It's disgusting.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.520
That's rude.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.650
Well, say what you will.

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:39.070
What happened?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.800
That's what I want to know.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.690
Good morning!

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:45.440
Right.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.900
You be happy, too!

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.330
Good morning, Makoto.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.980
Oh, good morning.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.440
Did something happen to him?

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:54.200
Who knows?

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.450
Maybe something good happened at the fair?

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:58.880
Something good?

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.120
Why are you asking me?

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:04.340
I just thought you might know if we're talking about Taisuke.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.540
Kuroda, you didn't ask him out in the end?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.730
"In the end?!"

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:10.330
What do you mean "in the end?!"

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.870
And besides, I was too busy helping with customers!

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.050
I see...

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:19.440
Hikari was so cute in her outfit that the customers wouldn't leave her alone.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:22.370
Oh yeah, you did look the best in that maid outfit.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:25.490
I'm not happy one bit when you flatter me.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.510
Besides, all you did was slack off!

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:30.580
I was watching things in my own way.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.250
Hey, just who was watching who?

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.340
No, well...

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:38.520
If I didn't keep my eye on you,
you wouldn't know right from left.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.820
I'm not that bad.

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:44.500
Right. The folk dance couple being hot with each other this morning.

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:52.190
Jeez, you got us.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.470
What are you guys getting embarrassed about?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:02.160
I was so excited I couldn't sleep!

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:07.260
It's sad we couldn't dance together, but I'll do my best!

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.810
I won't betray you!

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:14.080
So, if you'd like...

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:17.170
Take these!

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.500
I traded three months of lunch duty with my sister for these!

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.040
They're tickets for a Christmas Special dinner.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.590
Have a wonderful white Christmas with me!

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:26.870
Something like that.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.370
I don't know what you're saying.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.480
I'm dating Makoto-kun.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.800
Hey, what are you say-?!

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.180
He's with Saionji...

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:42.600
I'm dating Makoto-kun, so I can't date you.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.560
Please don't make me say this over and over again.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:50.060
You don't mean anything to me.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.730
Ignore what happened yesterday, as well.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.240
Excuse me.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:08.450
Makoto, what is this about?!

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:10.210
What is it? You're being loud.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:13.770
Are you still planning on going out with Katsura-san?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.270
I just don't understand anymore.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.620
I don't understand Katsura-san!

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:18.870
I don't understand you!

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.060
Like I know.

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:23.430
You're cheating on Katsura with Saionji, aren't you?!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:27.730
No! What are you saying?!

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:32.930
Then why is Katsura-san saying that she's still dating you and being cold to me?

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:36.220
A-At any rate, she's misunderstanding something.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:39.120
There's nothing going on between me and her anymore.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.050
Really?

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:41.250
Really!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:45.220
Then she's just saying that because she hates me?

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:48.390
Th-That may be...

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.760
Then what was I?

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.760
Hey, Katsura.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:03.350
Your boyfriend didn't come for you yesterday, did he?

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:07.240
I think you should at least say you lied.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:10.510
I know you don't want to admit that Itou broke up with you, but...

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:13.010
He didn't break up with me.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:17.250
What are you saying? We're pretty sure about what happened.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.420
Right, Otome?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.150
Y-Yeah...

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.670
Like she says.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:26.520
I know that Katou-san likes Makoto-kun, but...

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:30.260
I'm sorry, I'm the one dating Makoto-kun.

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:33.660
I see...

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.060
Is that all you had to say?

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.620
If so, excuse me.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:38.770
Hey.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.990
Jeez, what are you doing?

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.580
Sorry, Katsura-san.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.710
You sure spilled those. Get your act together.

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:04.420
Is it okay to throw these away?

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:07.850
1-3 Maid Ca

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.150
See you in the PE Storage Room, then.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:16.830
Don't slack off.

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:20.540
I'm sowwy.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:21.790
Stop messing around.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.460
There.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.110
Thank you.

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.520
Were you emailing Katsura-san?

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:36.780
No.

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.900
Is Katsura-san still following you around?

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:39.860
No!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:42.560
Then do you still like Katsura-san?

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.470
I've told you no!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.860
I've already broken it off with her...

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:53.470
She asked me out yesterday, but I didn't go with her.

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:54.380
I see...

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.180
Believe me!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:09:01.250
She might not have given up yet, but in the long run...

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:04.620
Make sure you're actually broken up with her and only focus on Sekai.

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:07.760
I said we broke up...

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.130
Itou...

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:13.760
Focus only on Sekai. Promise me that.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:16.370
Kiyoura...

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.200
I don't have any time anymore.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.600
That's...

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.980
I'm going to leave tomorrow.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:25.870
Have you told Sekai that?

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:27.900
I haven't told her yet.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.810
That's bad.

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:35.750
I can't tell her unless you promise me you're definitely going to protect her.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:38.590
Sekai needs someone to support her.

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:44.790
We used to think that we'd always be together.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:48.110
We thought of each other as our other half.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.100
That's why-!

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:57.350
I just really started to get to know her at the start of second semester...

00:09:57.350 --> 00:10:00.040
and I only started dating her recently...

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:03.610
I can't really just be told to support her all of a sudden.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.100
You're...

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:10.660
There's nothing going on with Kotonoha anymore.

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:11.760
Okay.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:17.320
But, I wonder why Taisuke thinks I'm going out with her.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.790
Sawanaga does?

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:23.310
This misunderstanding would never have happened if it weren't for him and his big mouth.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:24.230
Makoto-kun.

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:32.340
Hey!

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:41.730
Both of you were on the planning board, so you came to help clean up.

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:43.940
Kotonoha, are you cleaning by yourself?

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.720
I'm fine.

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:48.230
You shouldn't have carried all of that at once.

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.830
Here, I'll carry it.

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:57.340
Thank you.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.010
See you.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.800
U-Um, Makoto-kun.

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:03.500
Could we see each other on our day off tomorrow?

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:09.780
Our yacht is undergoing maintenance and it just arrived at the dock, but if you'd like...

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.310
You know, Kotonoha...

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.090
No.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.270
He has to do something with me tomorrow.

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.060
Th-That's how it is, so...

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:19.520
I'm sorry.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:25.840
Oh, you're right... I wouldn't be able to make plans with you out of nowhere like that...

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:27.740
How about next week?

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.270
I'm not really good at this, but...

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:34.160
I don't think we should see each other anymore.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:39.500
If we were close together,
someone will misunderstand...

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.040
That can't be true.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:43.470
What's wrong, Makoto-kun?

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:49.120
Oh, K-Kiyoura-san's making you say that, right? She's conspiring with Saionji-san.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.850
It has nothing to do with Sekai.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.520
I won't believe you!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:56.740
Saionji-san ordered you to do this.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:58.240
There's no way that could happen.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:03.250
Then do you want me to tell him? I'll tell him about what happened at the fair.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:06.070
What is she talking about?

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:10.470
It'd be a problem if Saionji-san knew, wouldn't it?

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:13.330
Saionji-san doesn't know how you actually feel.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:16.940
So she's ordering you to do all of these things.

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:20.480
What is she talking about? Your feelings?

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:26.690
The day before the school fair, while you were sleeping, Kiyoura-san kissed...

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:34.630
...you...

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:36.870
And?

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.670
This is how it is.

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:41.910
You're bugging us.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.280
No way.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:47.150
You didn't notice what was going on between us during the meetings?

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.920
Then what about Saionji-san?

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:55.340
What goes on between Sekai and I is none of your business.

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:56.020
But...

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:57.860
Don't come near us anymore.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.940
That can't be right...

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:04.230
Makoto-kun, I mean, this morning-!

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:08.730
I just wanted to apologize for not going...

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:10.120
Get it already.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.050
I'm so-

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:35.290
I...don't like you anymore.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:58.100
Bye-bye. See you later.

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.780
See you! Bye-bye!

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:09.210
Leave a message after the beep.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:12.600
Jeez, Makoto where'd you run off to.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:14.990
He doesn't really look like it, but Itou's pretty popular.

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:16.670
Make sure you hold on to him.

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:17.610
Yeah...

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:20.300
So, about tomorrow...

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.840
Oh, you mean the girl's basketball party?

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.950
I'm not really part of the team. You sure it's okay?

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:29.370
Yeah, one of the seniors bugged me to find people.

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:32.980
I'm working tomorrow at night, so I guess it'll be fine.

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:35.530
Okay, then I guess you'll be there.

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.710
That helps.

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:38.460
Setsuna, you want to come too?

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.290
Party?

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:40.880
Yeah.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:42.520
Setsuna, you come, too.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:43.530
Tomorrow, I...

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:48.030
I can't tomorrow.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.620
That sucks.

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:51.720
Setsuna's out...

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.640
Anyway, I have work.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:55.070
Where's Itou?

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:57.140
I was looking for him, but...

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:00.210
Oh yeah, didn't you take out the trash with him?

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:00.860
Yeah.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:05.190
I bet he just went to mess around after that and forgot everything else.

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:07.150
So it wasn't Sekai...

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.660
I'll go look for Itou.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:12.640
Really?

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.260
I guess I'll leave it to you?

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:15.760
Yeah.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:17.610
Thanks!

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:19.050
Sure. Bye-bye.

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.140
Bye-bye...

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.600
Asked me out again right after yesterday, huh?

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:31.930
Too much work?

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:32.880
Yeah right.

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:36.420
I didn't feel like just going home.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.550
Well, it's kind of thrilling.

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:40.700
Hey...

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.950
You look like you've been thinking all day.

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:47.620
Well, it's just that...

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:54.580
No matter what I do, it seems like a pain.

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:56.080
With me, too?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.870
No, you're...

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:03.190
You're not very good at this.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.450
Really?

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.110
I'm fine just being like this.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:12.530
I thought you really didn't think of me as a woman this whole time,

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:16.590
so being acknowledged like this makes me happy, I guess.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.420
Otome...

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:24.530
Itou...

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.660
Itou...

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:44.560
Sis, what are you doing up this late?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.130
Sis?

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.490
What should I do...?

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:12.480
Hello?

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.310
Itou.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.390
Kiyoura?

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:16.950
Are you home?

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:19.720
Of course I am. Look at the time.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.870
Good.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:31.560
I thought you were just saying you were going to spend time with me to lie to Kotonoha.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:35.070
Aren't you going to leave tonight?

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:38.070
There's something I have to talk to you about first.

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:43.860
Itou, after you were with me yesterday,
what were you doing in the PE storage room?

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:48.980
That isn't any of your business.

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:52.850
I told you to take care of Sekai.

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:55.970
It's not like I don't like her anymore.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.590
That was more...

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.220
Break it off with her, too.

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:05.330
If Sekai knew this...

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.530
So you kept it a secret?

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:12.230
There's no way I could tell her.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.100
Why are you doing so much?

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.170
It's for Sekai.

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:22.510
That's what you say, but you actually like me, don't you?

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:24.250
How could I?!

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:25.950
But you don't dislike me, do you?

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:29.750
You actually put feelings into that kiss yesterday.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.120
No!

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:45.370
Break up with her, like how you broke up with Katsura-san...

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:50.970
If you can promise me that,
you can do anything you want.

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.210
Anything...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.460
I...

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:04.320
So they're going to have the party here?

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:06.530
Our team room is too small.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:18.120
A/V Room

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:10.330
So, did you find Itou yesterday?

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.760
He didn't call me at all.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:15.990
Setsuna was supposed to look for him, but I couldn't get a hold of her.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:18.100
Maybe they were out cheating on you.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:21.800
No way that would happen.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.660
How are things going with your boyfriend?

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:28.110
I guess just okay.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:29.850
Look at you!

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:33.350
You can get him to be nicer to you since he's older.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:35.010
I wonder about that...

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:38.090
Oh, Otome, you're late.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:42.880
Is this the first time you've met each other outside of PE?

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:44.170
I guess so.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:44.170
Y-Yeah...

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:49.120
This is Saionji Sekai. They told us to bring more people, so I invited her.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.000
Hi.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.280
Hi.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.000
Okay, we're going to begin.

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.870
Sorry to make all of you wait.

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:02.380
We're now starting the special screening that you've all been waiting for.

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.900
It wasn't a party?

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:06.620
That's what I heard, but...

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:15.760
Nanami...

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:22.840
Actually, during the fair, we snuck a camera into the Break Room that you all know and love.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:25.370
You mean like a hidden camera?!

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:26.600
That's right.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:27.410
Wai-

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.980
No!

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:35.480
Let's all enjoy everyone's wonderful memories of the fair.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.640
Hey, let's go home.

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:40.120
Okay?

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:46.330
Katou's pretty aggressive!

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.330
No way!

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.010
Makoto!

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:04.560
Makoto, pick up!

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:24.730
Pick up, Makoto!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.060
Makoto!

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.040
Katsura-san...

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.110
Katsura-san!

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.700
Saionji-san.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:48.010
Do you know where Kiyoura-san is?

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.900
She was supposed to be with Makoto today.

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:59.060
Makoto-kun wasn't home, and if he wasn't home, they should be out somewhere together.

00:23:45.810 --> 00:23:47.300
Kiyoura!

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.810
Kiyoura!

00:23:59.950 --> 00:24:01.590
Where are you going to sit, Setsuna?

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:03.460
Number 4.

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:05.290
That's...

00:24:07.850 --> 00:24:09.910
Setsuna, trade with me.

00:24:09.910 --> 00:24:11.040
Sekai...

00:24:11.040 --> 00:24:13.380
Trade seats with me, okay?

00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:15.870
Sekai, do you...

00:24:16.290 --> 00:24:17.300
No, it's...

00:24:22.320 --> 00:24:25.010
You won't?

00:24:27.450 --> 00:24:28.980
No, it's okay.

00:24:37.740 --> 00:24:38.940
Goodbye.
